It is certainly more difficult to get it than in Vanilla, but there
are so many different ways to get poison resistance.

http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Poison_resistance

I like the - probably almost never used in Vanilla - method of wearing
a ring of sustain ability when eating poisonous corpses. :-)

> Unless UnNetHack is different in this from Vanilla, too, poison res is
> perfectly easy to get when you have a WoW. You should wish for a tin of
> the obvious meat.

As you get much less wishes out of a WoW in UnNetHack than in Vanilla,
you shouldn't waste one of those precious wishes for poison
resistance.

But a non-magical wish from fountains or magic lamps for such a corpse
or a tinning kit would do.

